title CF-M03 — Independent link disablement and fresh request
start
:CF-M03-S01\nInitiating actor\nOwner separately requests\ndisablement of a specific link.;
if (CF-M03-S02\nCurrent owner can control the\nexact link?) then (yes)
:CF-M03-S03\nOwner\nSeparately request disablement; no\nPDF edit required;
:CF-M03-S04\nSystem\nAttempt exact permitted link-state\nchange;
if (CF-M03-S05\nEffective disablement confirmed?) then (yes)
:CF-M03-S06\nViewer / System\nEvaluate a fresh protected request\nagainst current link state;
:CF-M03-S07\nSystem\nDeny fresh access via disabled\nlink; preserve download\nconfiguration;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M03-S08\nSystem\nDo not report disabled; retain\nknown outcome and reconcile\nunknown effect;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M03-S09\nSystem\nDeny before prohibited effect or\nprotected disclosure; report unmet\ngate;
stop
endif
legend bottom
A: accepted profile core only. Other policy detail: P / proposed refinement.
Step IDs identify full descriptions in the activity view.
Logical ordering; no atomicity, runtime, timing or execution proof.
endlegend
@enduml
